<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>截图粘贴试验 · GUCCANG</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/image_paste_demo.css?v=2">
    <script src="/js/theme.js?v=3"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css?v=3">
</head>
<body>
    <main class="demo-shell">
        <header class="demo-header">
            <a class="back-link" href="/editor">← 返回编辑器</a>
            <span class="eyebrow">交互试验</span>
        </header>
        <section class="intro">
            <p class="kicker">截图直接进入文章</p>
            <h1>粘贴一张图片，看看感觉是否自然。</h1>
            <p>先截屏后按 <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>V</kbd>，或把本地图片直接拖入编辑区。本页不会保存任何图片或博客。</p>
        </section>
        <section class="workspace" aria-label="截图粘贴试验区">
            <div class="editor-panel">
                <div class="panel-label"><span class="signal"></span> Markdown 编辑区 <span id="paste-state" class="state">等待粘贴</span></div>
                <textarea id="demo-editor" spellcheck="false" aria-label="Markdown 编辑区"># 我的记录

把截图粘贴到这里。</textarea>
                <p class="hint">支持截图粘贴和本地图片拖入。普通文字仍按原方式粘贴。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="preview-panel">
                <div class="panel-label">实时预览 <span class="preview-note">仅本次页面有效</span></div>
                <div id="preview" class="preview" aria-live="polite">等待截图粘贴</div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="markdown-card">
            <div>
                <p class="card-title">将来写入文章的内容</p>
                <p class="card-copy">正式接入后，上传成功会自动把 Markdown 图片引用插入到光标位置。</p>
            </div>
            <code id="markdown-output">等待粘贴图片…</code>
        </section>
    </main>
    <script src="/js/image_paste_demo.js?v=2"></script>
</body>
</html>
